{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他很在乎对方，仍然想靠近，但怕自己的在意显露太多、被对方嫌弃；只有对方相处态度没有变化，他才能安心。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"在意、犹豫、孤单、害怕被嫌弃、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"白天相处很好、独处时心头泛酸，刚说算了却放不下等具体处境；水面、古桥、月光等画面与身体感受、幻想交叠的内容，需要逐句读。右侧三条小字也不容易一眼读全。\",\n      \"score\": 4\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他很在乎对方，想继续保持亲近，却担心自己表现得太在乎、要求太多会被嫌弃，因此格外在意对方是否一如既往。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"依恋、犹豫、孤单、害怕被拒绝、留恋\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间五行的具体情境和情绪变化没有全部抓到，尤其是白天相处与独处时的反差、亲近的人也无法进入内心每个角落，以及音乐画面和身体感受的具体联系。\",\n      \"score\": 4\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他舍不得这段亲近，想靠近对方，却怕自己的心意被嫌弃，也在猜对方是不是同样舍不得这份关系。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"在意、孤独、怕被嫌弃、舍不得、患得患失\",\n      \"missed\": \"具体的关系回想、独处时的酸涩，以及气味、遗憾、身体感觉和幻想混在一起的部分，需要仔细读中间文字才能理解；右侧的小字信息也较难抓全。\",\n      \"score\": 4\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 4,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"中间五行的信息密度较高，音乐画面、关系处境、情绪和身体感受连续并列，彼此之间缺少明显的视觉层次。上下两条大字已经能把人物的核心处境和感受串起来，但中间那些画面与人物当下的关系不容易一眼看明白，需要逐句读才能建立联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1f7a8202-8c96-4ccc-861e-d8eda2820724", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T002409839374Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:25:14.306537+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "13b3033e458b0da39b16327172f350f069247bbf4741331dbb0c439e9f4e87bb", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T002409839374Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "827e421d15e3e1b14c3a2e9806b4377a3bf1717724517cb11efbd4bf13324adf"}}}
